Review: Doppler trans‐thoracic echocardiography for detection of pulmonary hypertension in adults
Total studies to screen: 155

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included studies that evaluated the diagnostic accuracy of trans‐thoracic Doppler echocardiography for detecting PH, 
