│ resistance in pulmonary hypertension", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Determination of pulmonary vascular resistance (PVR)  │
│ in patients with suspected or known pulmonary hypertension (PH) requires right heart catheterization. Our purpose    │
│ was to use Doppler echocardiography to estimate PVR in patients with PH. METHODS Patient population consisted of 52  │
│ patients (53 +/- 12 years; 35 females) who underwent Doppler echocardiography and right heart catheterization within │
