│ (n\xa0= 115), sensitivity and specificity reached 89% and 89%, respectively. No combination of parameters produced   │
│ an improvement on the initial results. CONCLUSIONS In the real-world practice of a conventional echocardiography     │
│ department, Doppler echocardiography is associated with high accuracy, sensitivity, and specificity for PH           │
│ evaluation, thus confirming its major position as a primary noninvasive tool."}, {"study_index": 155, "title":       │
